        "date": "2026-10-14T01:57:03Z"
      },
      "message": "src: keep ALS store in AsyncResource::MakeCallback\n\nAsyncResource saves the async context frame when it is created, and\nMakeCallback() enters it with async_context_frame::Scope. Then\nnode::MakeCallback() opens the callback scope with an undefined frame,\nso the callback never runs in the saved one. Since AsyncContextFrame is\nthe default, AsyncLocalStorage loses its store in these callbacks.\n\nPass the saved frame to InternalMakeCallback(), as the Node-API\nAsyncContext already does. This also removes the Scope from every call,\nwith its two Environment lookups and its global handle.\n\nRefs: https://github.com/nodejs/node/pull/66316\nRefs: https://github.com/nodejs/node/issues/43038\nRefs: https://github.com/nodejs/performance/issues/24\nSigned-off-by: Nigro Simone <nigro.simone@gmail.com>\nPR-URL: https://github.com/nodejs/node/pull/66326\nReviewed-By: Yagiz Nizipli <yagiz@nizipli.com>\nReviewed-By: Chengzhong Wu <legendecas@gmail.com>",
      "tree": {
        "sha": "3d20fda742e27c297a2fec2c397eaa166e62d89c",
        "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/nodejs/node/git/trees/3d20fda742e27c297a2fec2c397eaa166e62d89c"
      },
      "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/nodejs/node/git/commits/a0ce8f152bb1536b2c06dcfcc69db080bcdb6cd5",
      "comment_count": 0,
      "verification": {
        "verified": true,
        "reason": "valid",
        "signature": "-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqzuFvCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAVcAQAG+fZvLG/ndBrSHMddB52A+U\nmG7iTp3F9YolMrvbLQn3z2YQ0xIO3venggXQF4ekfvUAs4XBT2Iypsjf7wFbjBAd\nyMKAr/Dxk23thoeuzeeQ7Ow7GRWTjlkq4EPlkgx0Vx54FWxh9b6ozvlI4ftiVeh5\nfbhwiYNMAlrE8ITciLeNr+ugxrTpw7nNWXuN/6EsbcckPqixheNEk9eiz4Aiy3qk\nbrjBfsz6/a+MqIvujMKYblcpRYpu6DqySNHW4t4v9XzMZGHEocxkGmNkSdu3rfqt\npjauwkC3VqsVr395GkniZnFVZ9H9cGw2E3gZoUruma3SgmECIYnhPbc/tbqXVwiR\n8owAUH70Ch20BPKA60rYbQRFq3gaEclkH/o+9HTdU5lOITUd5PlKPueqpoPP3tPh\npqotzJUftb4ItJPdw80+uJ6ul958IS09cbGBsrytkFP5Jk++KDUf0x8odP8LK0LZ\ntDGYscvnIc8E1buLlqjLQotD9jHY2RZmfGP0QHDKcNZ9fvAmqupAKh55ZI6LgHqt\nS7xrjTFUJjtEvUKAFeQTSZUQvTFNL+I660XscQzhQSF5hGvDzcFI1/XeVwrR7na0\nwf/WEnZ8pj4XcBKuSQ9fcgrtx4MprLneMri3HPEB1oWK/ioea04kLdIqUOFvALay\nY2c+oq6UFRP16QdwOQJN\n=IJhS\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n",
        "payload": "tree 3d20fda742e27c297a2fec2c397eaa166e62d89c\nparent 04fb145b6a3d0dc3cf06fcbcd1d3c0414fdc193c\nauthor Nigro Simone <nigro.simone@gmail.com> 1791943023 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791943023 +0000\n\nsrc: keep ALS store in AsyncResource::MakeCallback\n\nAsyncResource saves the async context frame when it is created, and\nMakeCallback() enters it with async_context_frame::Scope. Then\nnode::MakeCallback() opens the callback scope with an undefined frame,\nso the callback never runs in the saved one. Since AsyncContextFrame is\nthe default, AsyncLocalStorage loses its store in these callbacks.\n\nPass the saved frame to InternalMakeCallback(), as the Node-API\nAsyncContext already does. This also removes the Scope from every call,\nwith its two Environment lookups and its global handle.\n\nRefs: https://github.com/nodejs/node/pull/66316\nRefs: https://github.com/nodejs/node/issues/43038\nRefs: https://github.com/nodejs/performance/issues/24\nSigned-off-by: Nigro Simone <nigro.simone@gmail.com>\nPR-URL: https://github.com/nodejs/node/pull/66326\nReviewed-By: Yagiz Nizipli <yagiz@nizipli.com>\nReviewed-By: Chengzhong Wu <legendecas@gmail.com>",
        "verified_at": "2026-10-14T01:57:04Z"
